### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create Audit Log
POST http://localhost:8000/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "USER_ACTION",
  "source": "auth-service",
  "action": "user-login",
  "user_id": "user123",
  "details": {
    "ip": "192.168.1.1",
    "browser": "Chrome"
  },
  "tags": ["authentication", "security"]
}

### Get Logs
GET http://localhost:8000/logs?category=USER_ACTION&limit=10

### Get Logs with Time Range
GET http://localhost:8000/logs?start_time=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&end_time=2025-12-31T23:59:59Z&limit=10

### Get Logs with Search
GET http://localhost:8000/logs?search_text=login&limit=10

### Analyze Logs
POST http://localhost:8000/logs/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "SECURITY",
  "start_time": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2025-01-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Get Security Incidents
GET http://localhost:8000/security/incidents

### Function App Endpoints

### Create Log (Function App)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/create_log
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "SYSTEM_EVENT",
  "source": "app-service",
  "action": "system-startup",
  "details": {
    "version": "1.2.3",
    "environment": "production"
  },
  "tags": ["system", "startup"]
}

### Get Logs (Function App)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/get_logs?category=SYSTEM_EVENT&limit=10

### Analyze Logs (Function App)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/analyze_logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "SYSTEM_EVENT",
  "start_time": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "end_time": "2025-01-31T23:59:59Z"
}